cloudflared-armv7
=================

This repository packages the official `cloudflared` release binary for 32-bit
ARM (armhf / armv7) into a container image. It is an unofficial community
build and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or supported by Cloudflare, Inc.

The packaging in this repository (Dockerfile, workflows, scripts,
documentation) is distributed under the MIT License — see LICENSE.

The binary shipped inside the resulting image is `cloudflared`:

    https://github.com/cloudflare/cloudflared
    Copyright (C) Cloudflare, Inc.
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

It is downloaded unmodified from the official GitHub release assets
(`cloudflared-linux-armhf`) at build time, and its checksum is verified against
the checksums published in the upstream release notes. A copy of the upstream
Apache-2.0 license is included in the image at:

    /usr/local/share/licenses/cloudflared/LICENSE

"Cloudflare", "Cloudflare Tunnel" and "cloudflared" are trademarks of
Cloudflare, Inc. They are used here only to identify the upstream software
being packaged.
